<li><p class='igt' id='i72'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/73.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i72w'><span class="word" id="i72w0">Genithtogits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i72w1">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i72g'><span class="gloss" id="i72g0">she did not glance</span><span class="gloss" id="i72g1">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i72ft'>'She did not glance around.'</span></p></li>
