<li><p class='igt' id='i113'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/114.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i113w'><span class="word" id="i113w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i113w1">eygginh</span><span class="word" id="i113w2">engan</span><span class="word" id="i113w3">nuq'oɬonh</span><span class="word" id="i113w4">viyiɬ vitithuquyh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i113g'><span class="gloss" id="i113g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g1">that person</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g2">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g3">woman</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g4">she was about to go to sleep</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i113ft'>'Across from him the woman was about to go to sleep.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i114'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/115.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i114w'><span class="word" id="i114w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i114w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i114w2">anh</span><span class="word" id="i114w3">idaghdhilinh</span><span class="word" id="i114w4">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i114w5">denedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i114w6">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i114w7">&quot;edi ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i114w8">etle'</span><span class="word" id="i114w9">go</span><span class="word" id="i114w10">dadz</span><span class="word" id="i114w11">xiyan'</span><span class="word" id="i114w12">ditast'eɬ</span><span class="word" id="i114w13">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i114w14">etle'</span><span class="word" id="i114w15">got,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i114w16">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i114g'><span class="gloss" id="i114g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g2">he</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g3">young man</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g4">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g5">he thought thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g6">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g7">always</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g8">perhaps</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g9">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g10">thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g11">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g12">I will do</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g13"></span><span class="gloss" id="i114g14">perhaps</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g15">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g16">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i114ft'>'And then the young man thought, &quot;perhaps I will always stay here in this way.&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i115'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/116.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i115w'><span class="word" id="i115w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i115w1">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i115w2">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i115w3">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i115w4">&quot;ndadz xonet</span><span class="word" id="i115w5">go</span><span class="word" id="i115w6">diyix</span><span class="word" id="i115w7">sits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i115w8">tr'axiyan (ni)xine'onh&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i115w9">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i115w10">anh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i115g'><span class="gloss" id="i115g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g1">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g2">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g3">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g4">for what reason</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g5">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g6">her house</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g7">to me</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g8">she revealed</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g9">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g10">he</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i115ft'>'Then he thought again, &quot;why did she reveal this house of hers to me?&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i116'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/117.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i116w'><span class="word" id="i116w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i116w1">che</span><span class="word" id="i116w2">denedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i116w3">che</span><span class="word" id="i116w4">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i116w5">&quot;dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i116w6">vits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i116w7">nidhisoy</span><span class="word" id="i116w8">anh,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i116w9">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i116g'><span class="gloss" id="i116g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g2">he thought thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g3">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g4">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g5">better</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g6">to her</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g7">I should go</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g8">her</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g9">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i116ft'>'And he thought, &quot;I should go over to her.&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i117'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/118.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i117w'><span class="word" id="i117w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i117w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i117w2">diggidiniɬnek.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i117g'><span class="gloss" id="i117g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i117g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i117g2">he arose</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i117ft'>'Then he arose.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i118'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/119.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i118w'><span class="word" id="i118w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i118w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i118w2">engtthit</span><span class="word" id="i118w3">go</span><span class="word" id="i118w4">yughontthit</span><span class="word" id="i118w5">nineyo</span><span class="word" id="i118w6">xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i118w7">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i118w8">yixizro</span><span class="word" id="i118w9">viɬandldaq</span><span class="word" id="i118w10">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i118w11">q'ididiyoq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i118g'><span class="gloss" id="i118g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g2">in front</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g3">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g4">in front of her</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g5">he stopped</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g6">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g7">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g8">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g9">he fell asleep</span><span class="gloss" id="i118g10"></span><span class="gloss" id="i118g11">he became like</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i118ft'>'As he crossed the house and went in front of her he suddenly lost consciousness.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i119'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/120.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i119w'><span class="word" id="i119w0">Yiggit</span><span class="word" id="i119w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i119w2">yughontthit</span><span class="word" id="i119w3">nineyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i119g'><span class="gloss" id="i119g0">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i119g1">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i119g2">in front of her</span><span class="gloss" id="i119g3">he stopped</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i119ft'>'Right in front of her he went.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i120'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/121.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i120w'><span class="word" id="i120w0">Xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i120w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i120w2">didiyoq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i120g'><span class="gloss" id="i120g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i120g1">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i120g2">it happened</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i120ft'>'There it happened.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i121'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/122.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i121w'><span class="word" id="i121w0">Viyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i121w1">ndagh</span><span class="word" id="i121w2">xidhu'onh</span><span class="word" id="i121w3">xiq'i</span><span class="word" id="i121w4">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i121g'><span class="gloss" id="i121g0">with him</span><span class="gloss" id="i121g1">somewhere</span><span class="gloss" id="i121g2">he is</span><span class="gloss" id="i121g3">as if</span><span class="gloss" id="i121g4">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i121ft'>'He could not tell where he was as if (in a dream).'<a href="#n17" class="notelink">17</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i122'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/123.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i122w'><span class="word" id="i122w0">Xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i122w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i122w2">anhtr'a</span><span class="word" id="i122w3">tr'an-ghididhiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i122w4">xiq'i</span><span class="word" id="i122w5">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i122g'><span class="gloss" id="i122g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i122g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i122g2">like</span><span class="gloss" id="i122g3">he is awakening</span><span class="gloss" id="i122g4">as if</span><span class="gloss" id="i122g5">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i122ft'>'Then it was as if he woke up.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i123'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/124.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i123w'><span class="word" id="i123w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i123w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i123w2">yiggit</span><span class="word" id="i123w3">diyix</span><span class="word" id="i123w4">yigginithido</span><span class="word" id="i123w5">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i123g'><span class="gloss" id="i123g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i123g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i123g2">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i123g3">his place</span><span class="gloss" id="i123g4">he sat back down</span><span class="gloss" id="i123g5">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i123ft'>'And then he sat back down in his own place.'<a href="#n18" class="notelink">18</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i124'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/125.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i124w'><span class="word" id="i124w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i124w1">denedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i124w2">ndadz</span><span class="word" id="i124w3">dist'anh</span><span class="word" id="i124w4">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i124w5">got?</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i124g'><span class="gloss" id="i124g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i124g1">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i124g2">how</span><span class="gloss" id="i124g3">I'm doing</span><span class="gloss" id="i124g4"></span><span class="gloss" id="i124g5">here</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i124ft'>'Then he thought, what am I doing here?'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i125'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/126.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i125w'><span class="word" id="i125w0">Gan</span><span class="word" id="i125w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i125w2">disiɬ'anh?</span><span class="word" id="i125w3">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i125w4">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i125g'><span class="gloss" id="i125g0">what</span><span class="gloss" id="i125g1">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i125g2">she does to me</span><span class="gloss" id="i125g3">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i125g4">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i125ft'>'What is she doing to me here?'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i126'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/127.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i126w'><span class="word" id="i126w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i126w1">engan</span><span class="word" id="i126w2">vits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i126w3">ntasiyo</span><span class="word" id="i126w4">ghilechenh</span><span class="word" id="i126w5">viɬaɬtingh,</span><span class="word" id="i126w6">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i126g'><span class="gloss" id="i126g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i126g1">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i126g2">to her</span><span class="gloss" id="i126g3">I went back</span><span class="gloss" id="i126g4">it seemed</span><span class="gloss" id="i126g5">he's asleep</span><span class="gloss" id="i126g6">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i126ft'>'And he thought, I thought I was going over to her but it seems (I) was asleep.'<a href="#n19" class="notelink">19</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i127'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/128.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i127w'><span class="word" id="i127w0">Hingo</span><span class="word" id="i127w1">engan</span><span class="word" id="i127w2">anh</span><span class="word" id="i127w3">nuq'oɬonh</span><span class="word" id="i127w4">giɬghex.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i127g'><span class="gloss" id="i127g0">meanwhile</span><span class="gloss" id="i127g1">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i127g2">she</span><span class="gloss" id="i127g3">woman</span><span class="gloss" id="i127g4">she's snoring</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i127ft'>'Meanwhile the woman snored over on the other side.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i128'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/129.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i128w'><span class="word" id="i128w0">Inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i128w1">chenh,</span><span class="word" id="i128w2">edisre'</span><span class="word" id="i128w3">se</span><span class="word" id="i128w4">go</span><span class="word" id="i128w5">dist'anh,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i128w6">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i128w7">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i128g'><span class="gloss" id="i128g0">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g2">I wonder</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g3">I</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g4">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g5">I'm doing</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g6">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i128g7">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i128ft'>'He thought again, I wonder what I'm doing here.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i129'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/130.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i129w'><span class="word" id="i129w0">&quot;Dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i129w1">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i129w2">nondhisdoy,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i129w3">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i129w4">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i129g'><span class="gloss" id="i129g0">better</span><span class="gloss" id="i129g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i129g2">I will go over</span><span class="gloss" id="i129g3">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i129g4">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i129ft'>'I think I'll go over again.&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i130'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/131.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i130w'><span class="word" id="i130w0">Ts'an</span><span class="word" id="i130w1">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i130w2">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i130w3">niɬk'ontithiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i130g'><span class="gloss" id="i130g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i130g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i130g2">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i130g3">he departed</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i130ft'>'And so he got up again.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i131'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/132.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i131w'><span class="word" id="i131w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i131w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i131w2">yit</span><span class="word" id="i131w3">xits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i131w4">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i131w5">got</span><span class="word" id="i131w6">tthitl'u'onhdi</span><span class="word" id="i131w7">nineyodi</span><span class="word" id="i131w8">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i131w9">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i131w10">viyiɬ viɬandldaq</span><span class="word" id="i131w11">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i131w12">q'ididiyoq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i131g'><span class="gloss" id="i131g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g2">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g3">to</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g4">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g5">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g6">where her head is</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g7">where he stopped</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g8">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g9">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g10">he went to sleep</span><span class="gloss" id="i131g11"></span><span class="gloss" id="i131g12">it happened</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i131ft'>'And when he reached the place where her head lay once more, once more he lost consciousness.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i132'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/133.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i132w'><span class="word" id="i132w0">Deg</span><span class="word" id="i132w1">viɬaɬtingh</span><span class="word" id="i132w2">q'idingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i132w3">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i132g'><span class="gloss" id="i132g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i132g1">he's sleping</span><span class="gloss" id="i132g2">he did as if</span><span class="gloss" id="i132g3">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i132ft'>'It was as if he was asleep.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i133'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/134.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i133w'><span class="word" id="i133w0">Xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i133w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i133w2">tr'anghididhiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i133w3">xiq'i</span><span class="word" id="i133w4">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i133w5">chenh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i133g'><span class="gloss" id="i133g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i133g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i133g2">he is awakening</span><span class="gloss" id="i133g3">as if</span><span class="gloss" id="i133g4">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i133g5">again</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i133ft'>'Then once again it was as if he awoke.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i134'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/135.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i134w'><span class="word" id="i134w0">Xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i134w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i134w2">yiggit</span><span class="word" id="i134w3">diyix</span><span class="word" id="i134w4">dhitanh</span><span class="word" id="i134w5">yiɬ xiq'angholnek.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i134g'><span class="gloss" id="i134g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i134g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i134g2">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i134g3">his place</span><span class="gloss" id="i134g4">he lies</span><span class="gloss" id="i134g5">he came to his senses</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i134ft'>'And he lay in his place and came to his senses.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i135'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/136.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i135w'><span class="word" id="i135w0">Xit'a</span><span class="word" id="i135w1">engodz</span><span class="word" id="i135w2">vitthe'</span><span class="word" id="i135w3">ghun'</span><span class="word" id="i135w4">niniso</span><span class="word" id="i135w5">ghilechenh?</span><span class="word" id="i135w6">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i135w7">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i135g'><span class="gloss" id="i135g0">I wonder why</span><span class="gloss" id="i135g1">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i135g2">her head</span><span class="gloss" id="i135g3">toward</span><span class="gloss" id="i135g4">I went</span><span class="gloss" id="i135g5">it seemed </span><span class="gloss" id="i135g6">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i135g7">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i135ft'>'I wonder why it seemed as if I went across to where she lies.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i136'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/137.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i136w'><span class="word" id="i136w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i136w1">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i136w2">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i136w3">chenh,</span><span class="word" id="i136w4">aɬa xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i136w5">gan</span><span class="word" id="i136w6">ditatl-'an'</span><span class="word" id="i136w7">di</span><span class="word" id="i136w8">got?</span><span class="word" id="i136w9">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i136g'><span class="gloss" id="i136g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g1">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g2">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g3">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g4">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g5">what</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g6">I started to do</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g7"></span><span class="gloss" id="i136g8">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i136g9">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i136ft'>'And he thought, what am I doing here?'<a href="#n20" class="notelink">20</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i137'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/138.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i137w'><span class="word" id="i137w0">Yitongo</span><span class="word" id="i137w1">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i137w2">engan</span><span class="word" id="i137w3">anh</span><span class="word" id="i137w4">nuq'oɬonh</span><span class="word" id="i137w5">viɬaɬtingh</span><span class="word" id="i137w6">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i137w7">yitongo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i137g'><span class="gloss" id="i137g0">meanwhile</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g1">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g2">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g3">she</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g4">woman</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g5">she's sleeping</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g6">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i137g7">meanwhile</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i137ft'>'Meanwhile the woman across the room continued to sleep.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i138'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/139.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i138w'><span class="word" id="i138w0">Ndadz</span><span class="word" id="i138w1">sre'</span><span class="word" id="i138w2">dist'anh</span><span class="word" id="i138w3">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i138w4">go?</span><span class="word" id="i138w5">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i138w6">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i138g'><span class="gloss" id="i138g0">what</span><span class="gloss" id="i138g1">I wonder</span><span class="gloss" id="i138g2">I'm doing</span><span class="gloss" id="i138g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i138g4">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i138g5">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i138g6">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i138ft'>'Now I wonder what's happening to me?'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i139'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/140.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i139w'><span class="word" id="i139w0">Dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i139w1">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i139w2">xan'enasitox,</span><span class="word" id="i139w3">inedhinh</span><span class="word" id="i139w4">chenh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i139g'><span class="gloss" id="i139g0">better</span><span class="gloss" id="i139g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i139g2">I will try</span><span class="gloss" id="i139g3">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i139g4">again</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i139ft'>'I think I'll try again, he thought.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i140'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/141.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i140w'><span class="word" id="i140w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i140w1">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i140w2">yits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i140w3">nontithiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i140g'><span class="gloss" id="i140g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i140g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i140g2">to her</span><span class="gloss" id="i140g3">he returned</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i140ft'>'So he went back to her again.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i141'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/142.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i141w'><span class="word" id="i141w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i141w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i141w2">yitthe'</span><span class="word" id="i141w3">q'idh</span><span class="word" id="i141w4">dux</span><span class="word" id="i141w5">ditadhiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i141g'><span class="gloss" id="i141g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i141g1">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i141g2">her head</span><span class="gloss" id="i141g3">by</span><span class="gloss" id="i141g4">shelf</span><span class="gloss" id="i141g5">he went up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i141ft'>'He went up to the bed where her head lay.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i142'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/143.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i142w'><span class="word" id="i142w0">Xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i142w1">nginugg</span><span class="word" id="i142w2">yix</span><span class="word" id="i142w3">nedr</span><span class="word" id="i142w4">iyixizro</span><span class="word" id="i142w5">yadz gititl'iqit.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i142g'><span class="gloss" id="i142g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i142g1">back</span><span class="gloss" id="i142g2">house</span><span class="gloss" id="i142g3">middle</span><span class="gloss" id="i142g4">suddenly</span><span class="gloss" id="i142g5">it opened up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i142ft'>'Then all of a sudden the back of the house opened up in the middle.'</span></p></li>
