<li><p class='igt' id='i185'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/186.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i185w'><span class="word" id="i185w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i185w1">&quot;nedhodiy</span><span class="word" id="i185w2">in tengeɬ,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i185w3">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i185g'><span class="gloss" id="i185g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i185g1">far off</span><span class="gloss" id="i185g2">you will dump it out</span><span class="gloss" id="i185g3">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i185ft'>&quot;'Empty it far away,&quot; he said.'</span></p></li>
