<li><p class='igt' id='i304'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/305.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i304w'><span class="word" id="i304w0">&quot;Daɬine'</span><span class="word" id="i304w1">ngiyiq</span><span class="word" id="i304w2">xiq'at,"</span><span class="word" id="i304w3">ditadhine'</span><span class="word" id="i304w4">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i304w5">yigginh</span><span class="word" id="i304w6">viqing'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i304g'><span class="gloss" id="i304g0">but</span><span class="gloss" id="i304g1">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i304g2">want,"</span><span class="gloss" id="i304g3">he told her</span><span class="gloss" id="i304g4">it is said</span><span class="gloss" id="i304g5">that person</span><span class="gloss" id="i304g6">her husband</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i304ft'>&quot;'But I want to stay down there," her husband told her.'</span></p></li>
