<li><p class='igt' id='i318'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/319.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i318w'><span class="word" id="i318w0">Ts'an</span><span class="word" id="i318w1">yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i318w2">yu'ot</span><span class="word" id="i318w3">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i318w4">che</span><span class="word" id="i318w5">xiditadhiyo</span><span class="word" id="i318w6">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i318g'><span class="gloss" id="i318g0">so then</span><span class="gloss" id="i318g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i318g2">his wife</span><span class="gloss" id="i318g3">to</span><span class="gloss" id="i318g4">also</span><span class="gloss" id="i318g5">he went up</span><span class="gloss" id="i318g6">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i318ft'>'And (the one who had left) went to his (cousin's) wife also.'</span></p></li>
