<li><p class='igt' id='i338'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/339.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i338w'><span class="word" id="i338w0">Aɬonache</span><span class="word" id="i338w1">itrix</span><span class="word" id="i338w2">hingo</span><span class="word" id="i338w3">yixi</span><span class="word" id="i338w4">ni'idiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i338g'><span class="gloss" id="i338g0">behold</span><span class="gloss" id="i338g1">she's crying</span><span class="gloss" id="i338g2">while</span><span class="gloss" id="i338g3">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i338g4">she went back</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i338ft'>'Apparently she had been crying as she went back.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i339'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/8__nox/mp3/340.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i339w'><span class="word" id="i339w0">Uxuxiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i339w1">chenh</span><span class="word" id="i339w2">eygginh</span><span class="word" id="i339w3">viqing'</span><span class="word" id="i339w4">vitr'eva</span><span class="word" id="i339w5">ditl'idhiyh</span><span class="word" id="i339w6">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i339g'><span class="gloss" id="i339g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i339g1">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i339g2">that person</span><span class="gloss" id="i339g3">her husband</span><span class="gloss" id="i339g4">his sadness</span><span class="gloss" id="i339g5">it came</span><span class="gloss" id="i339g6">it is said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i339ft'>'Then sadness came upon her husband.'</span></p></li>
